{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"上半屏左侧的大号白色文字段落，首先注意到开头的“他忽然说不清，想回去……”。下半屏金色音符动画次之，右上角目录较弱。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他想回去，但说不清自己为什么想回去；具体是留恋过去还是害怕孤单，第一眼未必能完整判断。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"不确定；能隐约感到不安，但焦虑和心慌需要继续扫读才能明确。\",\n  \"missed\": \"舍不得被当作自己人的日子与害怕孤单之间的具体拉扯；后面声音变化、门再次出现、重新遇见过去的自己，以及问题仍没有简单答案的含义。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"单块太长，一块里包含好几层意思，需要继续读长句才能弄清处境、感受及两者之间的关系。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a37a755f-a45c-4ec6-b913-c39991c05d95", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T015926506869Z", "elapsed_seconds": 37.391, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:00:03.913536+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6beb23640b9e6b8906d45a118b44b884cdfe8e4ded20ebd83db5acead32f60dd", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa2388